WEBVTT

1
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.962
<font color="white">SPOOKY IN LOVE</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:02:21.182 --> 00:02:23.393
{\an8}<font color="white">EPISODE 3</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.798
<font color="white">How dare you blackmail me?</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:02:53.882 --> 00:02:57.635
<font color="white">I didn't make a fuss</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when you copied my designs last season.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

5
00:02:57.719 --> 00:03:00.221
