<font color="white">my </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>haenyeo</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> diver dress.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

6
00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.392
<font color="white">It was a special dress I made</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">while thinking of my grandmother.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

7
00:03:05.977 --> 00:03:06.811
<font color="white">Hey. listen.</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:10.440
<font color="white">Why would I copy the design</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of a lowly nobody like you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

9
00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.775
<font color="white">You can run your mouth all you want.</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.444
<font color="white">but who would believe you?</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:18.698
