14
00:03:32.295 --> 00:03:34.380
<font color="white">You came well-prepared. didn't you?</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:03:35.423 --> 00:03:37.133
<font color="white">Give me that phone.</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:03:41.304 --> 00:03:42.472
<font color="white">Put my name on the design.</font><font color="white"></font>

17
