20
00:06:00.651 --> 00:06:01.819
<font color="white">Don't you have something to say?</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:06:04.614 --> 00:06:06.074
<font color="white">What do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:06:07.158 --> 00:06:08.451
<font color="white">It wasn't a coincidence. was it?</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:06:10.578 --> 00:06:12.580
<font color="white">The mountain where we first met.</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:06:12.663 --> 00:06:15.917
<font color="white">the taxi driver's body in the trunk.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and now. Jang Eun-ju.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

25
00:06:17.001 --> 00:06:19.587
<font color="white">It's a huge stretch.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but let's say that was all a coincidence.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

26
00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.130
<font color="white">But for this to be by chance too?</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.010
