29
00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.561
<font color="white">Let's talk about it another time.</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:06:36.479 --> 00:06:38.231
<font color="white">You should go inside and warm up.</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:06:44.904 --> 00:06:45.822
<font color="white">About earlier…</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:06:50.284 --> 00:06:51.285
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:06:55.498 --> 00:06:57.250
<font color="white">I might be used to how things are.</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:06:58.876 --> 00:07:00.670
