<font color="white">I swear. it was a setup.</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:07:35.663 --> 00:07:37.331
<font color="white">There must be a mistake!</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:07:37.415 --> 00:07:40.877
<font color="white">-Don't take any photos.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-It's all just a misunderstanding!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

40
00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.962
