<font color="white"><i>-Are you in Jeju Island?</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yeah.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

55
00:08:23.544 --> 00:08:25.171
<font color="white">Are you sure you're not here?</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:08:25.254 --> 00:08:27.298
<font color="white"><i>What nonsense are you on about?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:08:27.381 --> 00:08:31.260
<font color="white"><i>By the way. you must stay away</i></font><font color="white">
