58
00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:32.220
<font color="white">Okay.</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:08:35.264 --> 00:08:38.017
<font color="white">Man. is she psychic or something?</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:08:40.978 --> 00:08:42.438
<font color="white">Did you reach the airport safely?</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:44.607
<font color="white"><i>Yeah. I'm almost there.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

62
