<font color="white"><i>Sure.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:08:54.534 --> 00:08:56.994
<font color="white">I'll be going to Seoul soon.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so don't forget.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

67
00:09:06.087 --> 00:09:08.756
<font color="white">Why are you doing that yourself</font><font color="white">
