<font color="white">I heard about the nuisance.</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:09:12.677 --> 00:09:14.679
<font color="white">Oh. it's been taken care of.</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:09:15.763 --> 00:09:18.891
<font color="white">By the way.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">did you have a visitor earlier?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

71
00:09:24.855 --> 00:09:26.482
<font color="white">They grow so quickly.</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:09:26.566 --> 00:09:30.945
