73
00:09:36.576 --> 00:09:37.410
<font color="white"><i>Hey.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:09:37.493 --> 00:09:40.913
<font color="white">You should stay with her</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">until Da-mi is moved to the burial site.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

75
