<font color="white">I just can't seem to make sense of it.</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:23:58.687 --> 00:24:00.564
<font color="white">How did you know where to go?</font><font color="white"></font>

317
00:24:01.148 --> 00:24:04.442
<font color="white">You just happened to be there</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and found a body in the water tank.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

318
00:24:05.193 --> 00:24:06.486
<font color="white">and the prosecutor showed up too?</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:24:09.573 --> 00:24:11.491
<font color="white">About the weird rumors</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">going around about you…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

320
00:24:15.036 --> 00:24:17.122
<font color="white">Do you still see ghosts or something?</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:24:21.459 --> 00:24:22.419
<font color="white">You do. don't you?</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:24:24.921 --> 00:24:26.548
<font color="white">You always go</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:24:27.757 --> 00:24:29.593
<font color="white">a bit too far.</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:24:29.676 --> 00:24:32.721
<font color="white">I can't let a possessed shaman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">take over Reina.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

325
00:24:33.847 --> 00:24:35.223
<font color="white">If I reveal the truth about that.</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:24:35.849 --> 00:24:38.185
<font color="white">Grandma will give up the idea</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of letting you take over.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

327
00:24:40.645 --> 00:24:42.272
<font color="white">If that's all you have to say.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I'm leaving.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

328
00:25:21.561 --> 00:25:24.856
<font color="white">You that inhabit the body of this woman!</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:25:25.523 --> 00:25:27.651
<font color="white">You evil spirit!</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:25:28.443 --> 00:25:30.362
<font color="white">Begone!</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:25:34.783 --> 00:25:35.659
<font color="white">Yeo-ri?</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:25:37.827 --> 00:25:38.662
<font color="white">Yeo-ri.</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:25:41.748 --> 00:25:43.083
<font color="white">Grandma.</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:25:43.166 --> 00:25:44.542
<font color="white">Well done.</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:25:45.585 --> 00:25:46.920
<font color="white">You held up well.</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:25:47.796 --> 00:25:51.424
<font color="white">Shaman Baek said he suppressed the evil.</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:25:51.508 --> 00:25:52.509
<font color="white">How do you feel?</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:25:54.135 --> 00:25:56.388
<font color="white">Do you still see things?</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:26:06.564 --> 00:26:07.524
<font color="white">I don't…</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:26:10.568 --> 00:26:12.028
<font color="white">anymore.</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:26:14.990 --> 00:26:16.700
<font color="white">I guess they're gone.</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:26:48.273 --> 00:26:49.399
<font color="white"><i>Do it again.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

343
00:26:49.482 --> 00:26:51.318
<font color="white"><i>-Again?</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>-Do it again.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:26:57.907 --> 00:26:59.784
<font color="white">A hotel is not a facility!</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:26:59.868 --> 00:27:01.995
<font color="white">-It's where memories are made.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-It's where memories are made.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

346
00:27:02.078 --> 00:27:04.581
<font color="white">-Let's go. Reina!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Let's go!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

347
00:27:04.664 --> 00:27:07.459
<font color="white">-Enjoy yourselves. everyone.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Let's drink.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

348
00:27:42.994 --> 00:27:45.246
<font color="white">You want me to step down</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when I indicted him?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

349
00:27:45.330 --> 00:27:46.373
<font color="white">That makes no sense.</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:27:46.456 --> 00:27:49.918
<font color="white">Didn't I tell you to give in</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when you had the chance?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

351
00:27:50.001 --> 00:27:52.587
<font color="white">Even so. You should've shielded me.</font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:27:53.463 --> 00:27:54.756
<font color="white">Don't you know how we work?</font><font color="white"></font>

353
00:27:55.340 --> 00:27:57.384
<font color="white">We do whatever the higher-ups tell us.</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:27:57.467 --> 00:27:59.969
<font color="white">What if I were to get caught</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the backlash?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

355
00:28:00.053 --> 00:28:02.263
<font color="white">I must survive if I'm to help you out.</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:28:04.349 --> 00:28:06.101
<font color="white">I have to say. Assemblyman Park</font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:28:06.184 --> 00:28:07.894
<font color="white">has still got some fight left in him.</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:28:09.312 --> 00:28:12.023
<font color="white">Even after what his son did.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he managed to fight back hard.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

359
00:28:13.441 --> 00:28:15.318
<font color="white">TRANSFER NOTICE</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">CRIMINAL PROSECUTION 12. MA GANG-UK</font><font color="white"></font></font>

360
00:28:15.402 --> 00:28:17.112
{\an8}<font color="white">PROSECUTOR MA GANG-UK TO COLD CASE UNIT</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:28:17.195 --> 00:28:20.657
{\an8}<font color="white">We had already decided to beef up</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Criminal Prosecution</font><font color="white"></font></font>

362
00:28:21.282 --> 00:28:24.202
<font color="white">and revamp the Cold Case Unit anyway.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:28:24.994 --> 00:28:27.205
<font color="white">Solve some cases while you're over there.</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:28:29.582 --> 00:28:30.500
<font color="white">I'll bring you back</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">when the time is right.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

365
00:28:39.509 --> 00:28:42.011
<font color="white">Don't you think things are going backward?</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:28:42.095 --> 00:28:44.055
<font color="white">Why am I getting demoted</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for solving a case?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

367
00:28:44.139 --> 00:28:46.891
<font color="white">Accept it and go with the flow.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">It's not like this is anything new.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

368
00:28:46.975 --> 00:28:49.477
<font color="white">Fine. You wait and see.</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:28:49.561 --> 00:28:51.521
<font color="white">Let's see what you say</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if this happens to you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

370
00:28:51.604 --> 00:28:54.816
<font color="white">Just go. "Oh. I guess this is it then."</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:28:54.899 --> 00:28:56.985
<font color="white">"This is just how things are."</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:28:57.068 --> 00:29:00.280
<font color="white">If you take everything to heart.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you'll end up dying young.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

373
00:29:00.363 --> 00:29:02.031
<font color="white">-Aren't I right?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-You are.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

374
00:29:02.532 --> 00:29:04.743
<font color="white">I'm not even surprised. you know.</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:29:04.826 --> 00:29:07.120
<font color="white">Why are you more immature</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">than your junior?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

376
00:29:07.203 --> 00:29:10.081
<font color="white">Why do you keep yawning?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Did you not sleep well?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

377
00:29:10.165 --> 00:29:11.750
<font color="white">It's not that.</font><font color="white"></font>

378
00:29:12.333 --> 00:29:15.920
<font color="white">I just had a really stressful dream</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that felt so real.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

379
00:29:16.004 --> 00:29:17.380
<font color="white">In the dream.</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:29:18.631 --> 00:29:22.927
<font color="white">I was going somewhere when something</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">suddenly appeared in front of me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

381
00:29:23.553 --> 00:29:24.804
<font color="white">It was my late grandmother.</font><font color="white"></font>

382
00:29:24.888 --> 00:29:27.098
<font color="white">-Okay.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I asked her what was up.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

383
00:29:27.182 --> 00:29:29.476
<font color="white">She just stared at me.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">then all of a sudden</font><font color="white"></font></font>

384
00:29:29.559 --> 00:29:30.894
<font color="white">she went and…</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:29:32.312 --> 00:29:35.356
<font color="white">She hit me. She actually punched me.</font><font color="white"></font>

386
00:29:35.440 --> 00:29:37.400
<font color="white">"You good-for-nothing brat.</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:29:37.484 --> 00:29:40.612
<font color="white">how dare you not visit me once</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">while I was alive?"</font><font color="white"></font></font>

388
00:29:40.695 --> 00:29:43.239
<font color="white">"You don't deserve a good night's sleep!"</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:29:43.323 --> 00:29:45.366
<font color="white">She was exactly how I remember her.</font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:29:45.450 --> 00:29:47.952
<font color="white">You know those old canes</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that old people used?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

391
00:29:48.036 --> 00:29:49.913
<font color="white">It hurt when she hit you. didn't it?</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:29:49.996 --> 00:29:51.790
<font color="white">Don't even ask. It hurt badly.</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:29:52.290 --> 00:29:53.458
<font color="white">Who are you?</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:30:02.008 --> 00:30:03.718
<font color="white">That wasn't a dream.</font><font color="white"></font>

395
00:30:04.302 --> 00:30:05.595
<font color="white">Ms. Cheon?</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:30:08.932 --> 00:30:10.975
<font color="white">Cheon Yeo-ri.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">It's Cheon Yeo-ri. the heiress.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

397
00:30:11.059 --> 00:30:12.143
<font color="white">Mr. Ma.</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:30:13.645 --> 00:30:15.355
<font color="white">It's Prosecutor Ma Gang-uk.</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:30:15.438 --> 00:30:17.774
<font color="white">We shared a bed.</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:30:17.857 --> 00:30:19.359
<font color="white">You can't say that.</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:30:19.442 --> 00:30:21.319
<font color="white">-People could get the wrong idea.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-What?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

402
00:30:22.862 --> 00:30:24.697
<font color="white">What brings you here? Where are the rest?</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:30:26.157 --> 00:30:27.867
<font color="white">I didn't bring anyone else.</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:30:27.951 --> 00:30:29.536
<font color="white">I'm here on my own.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:30:29.619 --> 00:30:31.913
<font color="white">I didn't think you'd step foot</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in places like this.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

406
00:30:32.497 --> 00:30:34.123
<font color="white">They must know each other well.</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:30:34.207 --> 00:30:36.876
<font color="white">They don't just know each other.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I think they're best friends.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

408
00:30:36.960 --> 00:30:39.462
<font color="white">We can't stand not getting answers.</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:30:39.546 --> 00:30:40.797
<font color="white">-Right.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Hello. How are you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

410
00:30:40.880 --> 00:30:42.966
<font color="white">-Shall we?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-It's a pleasure to meet you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

411
00:30:43.466 --> 00:30:44.634
<font color="white">Stop.</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:30:46.928 --> 00:30:48.429
<font color="white">Maintain your distance.</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:30:49.222 --> 00:30:50.682
<font color="white">Take three steps back.</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:30:50.765 --> 00:30:52.433
<font color="white">Okay. Three steps back.</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:30:52.517 --> 00:30:54.143
<font color="white">One. two. three.</font><font color="white"></font>

416
00:30:54.227 --> 00:30:55.562
<font color="white">-Sit down.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Okay.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

417
00:30:56.563 --> 00:30:59.023
<font color="white">I'm doing this for your sake. you know.</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:30:59.107 --> 00:31:01.776
<font color="white">I'm putting up a wall to keep you safe.</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:31:01.860 --> 00:31:03.820
<font color="white">If you make the mistake</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of sitting with me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

420
00:31:04.320 --> 00:31:06.322
<font color="white">terrible things could happen to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:31:07.198 --> 00:31:10.076
<font color="white">That's why I paid in advance</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:31:11.119 --> 00:31:13.830
<font color="white">to keep the tables around me empty.</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:31:13.913 --> 00:31:17.292
<font color="white">So no one can even come near me.</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:31:17.375 --> 00:31:19.377
<font color="white">I get that you want to flaunt your money.</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:31:19.460 --> 00:31:21.588
<font color="white">but why bother to come here</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">just to drink alone?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

426
00:31:22.547 --> 00:31:23.381
<font color="white">"Why bother"?</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:31:24.382 --> 00:31:26.426
<font color="white">It's not the same.</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:31:26.509 --> 00:31:29.554
<font color="white">Here. if I look up from a drink.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:31:29.637 --> 00:31:30.930
<font color="white">I see people.</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:31:31.014 --> 00:31:33.641
<font color="white">At home. if I look up from a drink…</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:31:40.773 --> 00:31:41.608
<font color="white">Forget it.</font><font color="white"></font>

432
00:31:41.691 --> 00:31:45.403
<font color="white">-She emptied seven bottles of soju.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-She's out of it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

433
00:31:45.486 --> 00:31:48.406
<font color="white">Every now and then. I want to drink</font><font color="white"></font>

434
00:31:48.489 --> 00:31:51.826
<font color="white">among some ordinary people.</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:32:02.545 --> 00:32:04.213
<font color="white">Wait…</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:32:04.297 --> 00:32:05.965
<font color="white">Do it properly then.</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:32:06.049 --> 00:32:07.842
<font color="white">-What?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Come and join us.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

438
00:32:07.926 --> 00:32:09.802
<font color="white">-Yes. sure.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Shall we?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

439
00:32:09.886 --> 00:32:11.304
<font color="white">No. you can't.</font><font color="white"></font>

440
00:32:12.138 --> 00:32:14.140
<font color="white">-Go away. Leave.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Excuse us.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

441
00:32:14.223 --> 00:32:18.019
<font color="white">If you join me.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you might get a taste of the afterlife.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

442
00:32:18.102 --> 00:32:19.771
<font color="white">If we do. then so be it.</font><font color="white"></font>

443
00:32:20.355 --> 00:32:21.189
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:32:22.690 --> 00:32:23.733
<font color="white">Drink up.</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:32:26.778 --> 00:32:29.405
<font color="white">You filled my glass. so I should empty it.</font><font color="white"></font>

446
00:32:33.409 --> 00:32:34.953
<font color="white">It's been so long</font><font color="white"></font>

447
00:32:35.036 --> 00:32:37.497
<font color="white">since someone poured me a drink.</font><font color="white"></font>

448
00:32:41.626 --> 00:32:43.878
<font color="white">-They must have a thing.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-They're playing hard to get.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

449
00:32:43.962 --> 00:32:44.963
<font color="white">It's not like that.</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:32:45.880 --> 00:32:47.006
<font color="white">It's not.</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:32:50.593 --> 00:32:53.680
<font color="white">Earlier. when I was talking about</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the dream of my grandma.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

452
00:32:53.763 --> 00:32:55.556
<font color="white">what did you mean it wasn't a dream?</font><font color="white"></font>

453
00:32:55.640 --> 00:32:57.517
<font color="white">Oh. that?</font><font color="white"></font>

454
00:32:59.435 --> 00:33:00.812
<font color="white">You guys have no idea</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:33:01.562 --> 00:33:04.315
<font color="white">that the dead come visit you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">while you sleep. do you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

456
00:33:05.900 --> 00:33:08.111
<font color="white">They come and watch you while you sleep.</font><font color="white"></font>

457
00:33:09.195 --> 00:33:10.655
<font color="white">They just stare…</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:33:11.406 --> 00:33:12.240
<font color="white">like this.</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:33:12.824 --> 00:33:15.118
<font color="white">They sometimes give you sleep paralysis</font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:33:15.868 --> 00:33:17.203
<font color="white">or even strangle you.</font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:33:17.787 --> 00:33:20.790
<font color="white">People think they're just nightmares.</font><font color="white"></font>

462
00:33:25.044 --> 00:33:26.546
<font color="white">You think they're all dreams. don't you?</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:33:31.175 --> 00:33:33.094
<font color="white">You would never know</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:33:33.177 --> 00:33:35.596
<font color="white">when you only ever see one side of things.</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:33:37.223 --> 00:33:39.100
<font color="white">You can't drink soju out of a bowl.</font><font color="white"></font>

466
00:33:39.183 --> 00:33:40.351
<font color="white">That will kill you.</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:33:40.435 --> 00:33:42.603
<font color="white">What? Why would I die?</font><font color="white"></font>

468
00:33:42.687 --> 00:33:46.441
<font color="white">No. I mean if you drink this much at once.</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:33:46.524 --> 00:33:48.192
<font color="white">it'll ruin your liver and your stomach.</font><font color="white"></font>

470
00:33:48.276 --> 00:33:49.694
<font color="white">What if you were to fall ill?</font><font color="white"></font>

471
00:33:49.777 --> 00:33:52.071
<font color="white">It'd be hard on you.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but also on your family.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

472
00:33:52.155 --> 00:33:53.197
<font color="white">Shut up.</font><font color="white"></font>

473
00:33:57.410 --> 00:34:00.371
<font color="white">You think my family would worry about me?</font><font color="white"></font>

