00:45:21.135 --> 00:45:22.177
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

637
00:45:25.722 --> 00:45:26.640
<font color="white">Look. Mr. Ma.</font><font color="white"></font>

638
00:45:28.434 --> 00:45:31.103
<font color="white">By any chance. every now and then.</font><font color="white"></font>

639
00:45:31.603 --> 00:45:34.731
<font color="white">do you happen to see things</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you weren't able to before?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

640
00:45:37.901 --> 00:45:40.237
<font color="white">There's a tent in your living room.</font><font color="white"></font>

641
00:45:40.821 --> 00:45:42.489
<font color="white">Yes. well…</font><font color="white"></font>

642
00:45:42.573 --> 00:45:45.033
<font color="white">It's pretty cozy inside.</font><font color="white"></font>

643
00:45:45.117 --> 00:45:48.912
<font color="white">As you can see.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">this house is too big for me alone.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

644
00:45:50.247 --> 00:45:51.582
<font color="white">It really is quite big.</font><font color="white"></font>

645
00:45:51.665 --> 00:45:54.877
<font color="white">My parents used to live with me.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">though not anymore.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

646
00:45:57.921 --> 00:45:59.089
<font color="white">-Try the tea.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Thanks.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

647
00:46:07.931 --> 00:46:09.641
<font color="white">Why did you want me to come in?</font><font color="white"></font>

648
00:46:09.725 --> 00:46:11.685
<font color="white">You don't seem the type to have guests.</font><font color="white"></font>

649
00:46:12.728 --> 00:46:15.606
<font color="white">Well. you came all this way.</font><font color="white"></font>

650
00:46:15.689 --> 00:46:18.233
<font color="white">so it felt wrong</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to just send you on your way.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

651
00:46:18.317 --> 00:46:20.068
<font color="white">And I wanted to check something too.</font><font color="white"></font>

652
00:46:20.152 --> 00:46:22.196
<font color="white">Check what? With me?</font><font color="white"></font>

653
00:46:23.155 --> 00:46:24.490
<font color="white">So last night…</font><font color="white"></font>

654
00:46:25.282 --> 00:46:27.451
<font color="white">I was a bit out of line.</font><font color="white"></font>

655
00:46:28.118 --> 00:46:30.746
<font color="white">I touched you without my gloves…</font><font color="white"></font>

656
00:46:36.126 --> 00:46:37.294
<font color="white">Who's that kid?</font><font color="white"></font>

657
00:46:45.594 --> 00:46:46.970
<font color="white">Who is that?</font><font color="white"></font>

658
00:46:55.479 --> 00:46:57.940
<font color="white">-He's from next door.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-What's he doing here?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

659
00:47:00.275 --> 00:47:01.318
<font color="white">Playing hide and seek.</font><font color="white"></font>

660
00:47:01.401 --> 00:47:03.487
<font color="white">He comes here sometimes to play.</font><font color="white"></font>

661
00:47:03.570 --> 00:47:05.197
<font color="white">Oh. really?</font><font color="white"></font>

662
00:47:06.114 --> 00:47:07.241
<font color="white">He must be bored.</font><font color="white"></font>

663
00:47:07.783 --> 00:47:09.743
<font color="white">If it's because his parents aren't home.</font><font color="white"></font>

664
00:47:09.826 --> 00:47:11.495
<font color="white">-I'll play with him for a bit.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-No.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

665
00:47:12.204 --> 00:47:13.205
<font color="white">You can't do that.</font><font color="white"></font>

666
00:47:13.705 --> 00:47:14.748
<font color="white">You can't do anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

667
00:47:14.831 --> 00:47:16.750
<font color="white">I'm really good with kids.</font><font color="white"></font>

668
00:47:18.585 --> 00:47:21.004
<font color="white">You were here to return these. right?</font><font color="white"></font>

669
00:47:21.088 --> 00:47:22.923
<font color="white">You returned them and I received them.</font><font color="white"></font>

670
00:47:23.006 --> 00:47:24.049
<font color="white">All is well.</font><font color="white"></font>

671
00:47:24.132 --> 00:47:26.176
<font color="white">You can leave now.</font><font color="white"></font>

672
00:47:26.677 --> 00:47:27.719
<font color="white">Go on your way.</font><font color="white"></font>

673
00:47:28.303 --> 00:47:29.137
<font color="white">Goodbye.</font><font color="white"></font>

674
00:47:31.974 --> 00:47:33.642
<font color="white">-What was that?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-The wind.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

675
00:47:35.477 --> 00:47:38.021
<font color="white">The doors are closed.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">It couldn't have been the wind.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

676
00:47:39.356 --> 00:47:41.358
<font color="white">Could it be a burglar?</font><font color="white"></font>

677
00:47:41.900 --> 00:47:42.734
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

678
00:47:42.818 --> 00:47:44.820
<font color="white">They could've scaled the wall</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to hide somewhere.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

679
00:47:44.903 --> 00:47:46.655
<font color="white">I worked on a case like that.</font><font color="white"></font>

680
00:47:46.738 --> 00:47:49.283
<font color="white">Listen. I have a security system.</font><font color="white"></font>

681
00:47:49.366 --> 00:47:50.867
<font color="white">so that would be impossible.</font><font color="white"></font>

682
00:47:50.951 --> 00:47:51.785
<font color="white">Wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

683
00:47:52.369 --> 00:47:53.704
<font color="white">I could just be paranoid.</font><font color="white"></font>

684
00:47:53.787 --> 00:47:56.331
<font color="white">but it doesn't hurt to check.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and it won't take that long.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

685
00:47:57.207 --> 00:47:58.041
<font color="white">No.</font><font color="white"></font>

686
00:47:58.709 --> 00:47:59.668
<font color="white">It's not a burglar.</font><font color="white"></font>

687
00:48:01.587 --> 00:48:03.630
<font color="white">It must've been the kid.</font><font color="white"></font>

688
00:48:03.714 --> 00:48:06.425
<font color="white">You see. there's an open door in the back.</font><font color="white"></font>

689
00:48:06.508 --> 00:48:07.509
<font color="white">There is?</font><font color="white"></font>

690
00:48:08.302 --> 00:48:10.095
<font color="white">Goodness. what a sneaky kid.</font><font color="white"></font>

691
00:48:11.263 --> 00:48:12.389
<font color="white">Wait. Mr. Ma.</font><font color="white"></font>

692
00:48:12.889 --> 00:48:14.266
<font color="white">It's fine. It won't take long.</font><font color="white"></font>

693
00:48:14.349 --> 00:48:16.184
<font color="white">-I told you to go.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Just wait.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

694
00:48:17.561 --> 00:48:19.021
<font color="white">Are you in here?</font><font color="white"></font>

695
00:48:19.104 --> 00:48:20.022
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

696
00:48:20.105 --> 00:48:21.189
<font color="white">You're not in here.</font><font color="white"></font>

697
00:48:21.857 --> 00:48:23.734
<font color="white">I'd better get going then.</font><font color="white"></font>

698
00:48:23.817 --> 00:48:26.236
<font color="white">Ms. Cheon. you'll come with me. right?</font><font color="white"></font>

699
00:48:26.987 --> 00:48:27.863
<font color="white">Where?</font><font color="white"></font>

700
00:48:29.740 --> 00:48:31.658
<font color="white">-Come here.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-What are you…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

701
00:48:32.367 --> 00:48:35.120
<font color="white">What are you doing?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">How did you know this was a door?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

702
00:48:35.203 --> 00:48:36.705
<font color="white">What are you…</font><font color="white"></font>

703
00:48:51.553 --> 00:48:53.263
<font color="white">That must be him coming out.</font><font color="white"></font>

704
00:48:54.556 --> 00:48:55.474
<font color="white">Who do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

705
00:49:10.989 --> 00:49:12.616
<font color="white">Did you see that?</font><font color="white"></font>

706
00:49:12.699 --> 00:49:13.909
<font color="white">He moved so fast.</font><font color="white"></font>

707
00:49:13.992 --> 00:49:16.745
<font color="white">Gosh. it was like… He almost…</font><font color="white"></font>

708
00:49:16.828 --> 00:49:17.663
<font color="white">That was…</font><font color="white"></font>

709
00:49:18.163 --> 00:49:19.039
<font color="white">Excuse me.</font><font color="white"></font>

710
00:49:19.122 --> 00:49:20.374
<font color="white">Yes?</font><font color="white"></font>

711
00:49:20.957 --> 00:49:23.085
<font color="white">I'm really tired.</font><font color="white"></font>

712
00:49:24.753 --> 00:49:25.587
<font color="white">Please leave.</font><font color="white"></font>

713
00:49:27.673 --> 00:49:30.092
<font color="white">I was too dull-witted to catch on.</font><font color="white"></font>

714
00:49:30.884 --> 00:49:31.927
<font color="white">I'm sorry.</font><font color="white"></font>

715
00:49:43.021 --> 00:49:43.855
<font color="white">My coat.</font><font color="white"></font>

716
00:49:52.489 --> 00:49:53.740
<font color="white">What should I do now?</font><font color="white"></font>

717
00:49:54.991 --> 00:49:56.201
<font color="white">What do I do now?</font><font color="white"></font>

718
00:50:18.265 --> 00:50:19.266
<font color="white">Will he be okay?</font><font color="white"></font>

719
00:50:25.522 --> 00:50:26.815
<font color="white">What should I do?</font><font color="white"></font>

720
00:50:56.720 --> 00:50:58.847
<font color="white"><i>What are you doing over there. kid?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

721
00:50:58.930 --> 00:51:00.640
<font color="white"><i>Shouldn't you be going home?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

722
00:51:01.475 --> 00:51:03.351
<font color="white"><i>Library hours are over now.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

723
00:51:06.062 --> 00:51:08.440
<font color="white"><i>I can't go home.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

724
00:51:30.378 --> 00:51:31.421
<font color="white">That hurt.</font><font color="white"></font>

725
00:51:41.723 --> 00:51:42.557
<font color="white">I must be</font><font color="white"></font>

726
00:51:43.517 --> 00:51:44.434
<font color="white">way too on edge.</font><font color="white"></font>

727
00:52:12.838 --> 00:52:14.965
<font color="white">Why the hell won't this open?</font><font color="white"></font>

728
00:52:20.637 --> 00:52:22.389
<font color="white">-Hello?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>-Hello?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

729
00:52:23.473 --> 00:52:24.724
<font color="white">He's in my home right now.</font><font color="white"></font>

730
00:52:26.101 --> 00:52:28.353
<font color="white">-Who?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-The kid who was playing hide and seek.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

731
00:52:32.190 --> 00:52:33.441
<font color="white">-The little boy?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>-Yes.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

732
00:52:33.525 --> 00:52:34.901
<font color="white">He came all the way to my home.</font><font color="white"></font>

733
00:52:51.459 --> 00:52:52.460
<font color="white">Mr. Ma?</font><font color="white"></font>

734
00:52:53.295 --> 00:52:54.129
<font color="white">I'm here.</font><font color="white"></font>

735
00:52:54.629 --> 00:52:55.589
<font color="white">Over here.</font><font color="white"></font>

736
00:52:58.717 --> 00:53:00.427
<font color="white">Were you out here this whole time?</font><font color="white"></font>

737
00:53:04.347 --> 00:53:05.181
<font color="white">Sit down here with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

738
00:53:06.391 --> 00:53:07.601
<font color="white">What…</font><font color="white"></font>

739
00:53:09.060 --> 00:53:11.438
<font color="white">Who is that kid? He climbs walls too.</font><font color="white"></font>

740
00:53:24.492 --> 00:53:26.286
<font color="white">SOJU</font><font color="white"></font>

741
00:53:26.953 --> 00:53:28.455
<font color="white">You carry this stuff around with you?</font><font color="white"></font>

742
00:53:28.538 --> 00:53:31.708
<font color="white">It's a bag I keep handy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in case of emergencies.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

743
00:53:32.250 --> 00:53:33.627
<font color="white">Try to calm down.</font><font color="white"></font>

744
00:53:34.836 --> 00:53:35.754
<font color="white">Drink that first.</font><font color="white"></font>

745
00:53:49.434 --> 00:53:52.062
<font color="white">Do you feel a bit relaxed now?</font><font color="white"></font>

746
00:53:53.813 --> 00:53:54.898
<font color="white">What do you mean "relaxed"?</font><font color="white"></font>

747
00:53:54.981 --> 00:53:57.859
<font color="white">Are you going to say something</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that'll shock me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

748
00:54:00.320 --> 00:54:03.448
<font color="white">I have what it takes.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">You can say whatever it is.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

749
00:54:07.953 --> 00:54:08.954
<font color="white">Go on.</font><font color="white"></font>

750
00:54:09.037 --> 00:54:09.955
<font color="white">Are you sure?</font><font color="white"></font>

751
00:54:20.423 --> 00:54:21.341
<font color="white">No way.</font><font color="white"></font>

752
00:54:40.110 --> 00:54:41.778
<font color="white">You weren't relaxed enough.</font><font color="white"></font>

753
00:54:41.861 --> 00:54:44.489
<font color="white">Here. You need to stay with me.</font><font color="white"></font>

754
00:54:45.031 --> 00:54:47.325
<font color="white">Have a few more sips of alcohol.</font><font color="white"></font>

755
00:54:47.409 --> 00:54:49.244
<font color="white">Gulp it down. Don't spit it out.</font><font color="white"></font>

756
00:54:56.001 --> 00:54:57.877
<font color="white">-He's not here.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Okay.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

757
00:55:01.006 --> 00:55:03.008
<font color="white">How did you know the body was there?</font><font color="white"></font>

758
00:55:03.842 --> 00:55:05.343
<font color="white">-I was told.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-By whom?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

759
00:55:06.678 --> 00:55:07.804
<font color="white">By a ghost.</font><font color="white"></font>

760
00:55:09.139 --> 00:55:10.557
<font color="white">So she was telling the truth.</font><font color="white"></font>

761
00:55:16.896 --> 00:55:18.064
<font color="white">Should I just turn the lights on?</font><font color="white"></font>

762
00:55:18.982 --> 00:55:20.316
<font color="white">He doesn't like bright lights.</font><font color="white"></font>

763
00:55:22.444 --> 00:55:23.903
<font color="white">You're sticking too close to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

764
00:55:23.987 --> 00:55:25.905
<font color="white">I'm not standing that close.</font><font color="white"></font>

765
00:55:25.989 --> 00:55:27.449
<font color="white">Wait outside if you're scared.</font><font color="white"></font>

766
00:55:27.532 --> 00:55:30.243
<font color="white">I'm not scared. I'm just nervous.</font><font color="white"></font>

767
00:55:34.039 --> 00:55:36.541
<font color="white">-Do you live alone too?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

768
00:55:38.251 --> 00:55:41.504
<font color="white">Your place feels comfortable and cozy.</font><font color="white"></font>

769
00:55:42.213 --> 00:55:45.925
<font color="white">I owe that to my grandma.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">She sweeps and cleans whenever she visits.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

770
00:55:46.426 --> 00:55:48.553
<font color="white">Huh? Wait…</font><font color="white"></font>

771
00:55:50.972 --> 00:55:52.807
<font color="white">Does the kid like cars?</font><font color="white"></font>

772
00:56:04.778 --> 00:56:06.446
<font color="white">He's a kid. so he'll be hiding.</font><font color="white"></font>

773
00:56:10.075 --> 00:56:11.284
<font color="white">You must be good with housework.</font><font color="white"></font>

774
00:56:11.868 --> 00:56:14.621
<font color="white">Yes. I'm good at everything I do.</font><font color="white"></font>

775
00:56:36.935 --> 00:56:38.103
<font color="white">Oh. this is just…</font><font color="white"></font>

776
00:56:38.937 --> 00:56:41.106
<font color="white">I always check out of habit.</font><font color="white"></font>

777
00:56:41.189 --> 00:56:42.357
<font color="white">It's a work-related habit.</font><font color="white"></font>

778
00:56:50.281 --> 00:56:52.117
<font color="white">Do you think he could've left?</font><font color="white"></font>

779
00:56:54.536 --> 00:56:55.745
<font color="white">That's strange.</font><font color="white"></font>

780
00:56:56.329 --> 00:56:58.915
<font color="white">Kids rarely leave</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">once they latch onto you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

781
00:57:00.416 --> 00:57:01.960
<font color="white">Where do they stay if they don't go?</font><font color="white"></font>

782
00:57:04.879 --> 00:57:06.464
<font color="white">Why? What is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

783
00:57:07.674 --> 00:57:08.883
<font color="white">Kids tend to…</font><font color="white"></font>

784
00:57:08.967 --> 00:57:10.051
<font color="white">Yes?</font><font color="white"></font>

785
00:57:12.470 --> 00:57:13.680
<font color="white">Piggyback on people.</font><font color="white"></font>

786
00:57:28.528 --> 00:57:29.362
<font color="white">Get off me!</font><font color="white"></font>

787
00:57:30.321 --> 00:57:32.574
<font color="white">-Mr. Ma! Keep still!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Get off me!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

788
00:57:32.657 --> 00:57:34.117
<font color="white">Go away!</font><font color="white"></font>

789
00:57:35.285 --> 00:57:36.369
<font color="white">You said you weren't scared!</font><font color="white"></font>

790
00:57:37.912 --> 00:57:40.039
<font color="white">No! No!</font><font color="white"></font>

791
00:57:40.123 --> 00:57:41.207
<font color="white">Go away!</font><font color="white"></font>

792
00:57:43.418 --> 00:57:45.170
<font color="white">He's off your back now!</font><font color="white"></font>

793
00:57:45.253 --> 00:57:47.130
<font color="white">He's gone!</font><font color="white"></font>

794
00:57:48.089 --> 00:57:49.549
<font color="white">He's gone!</font><font color="white"></font>

795
00:57:50.049 --> 00:57:51.050
<font color="white">He's gone?</font><font color="white"></font>

796
00:57:51.551 --> 00:57:52.469
<font color="white">He's gone?</font><font color="white"></font>

797
00:58:45.855 --> 00:58:48.233
<font color="white">SPOOKY IN LOVE</font><font color="white"></font>

798
00:58:48.316 --> 00:58:49.984
{\an8}<font color="white">What do we do now?</font><font color="white"></font>

799
00:58:50.068 --> 00:58:51.819
{\an8}<font color="white">More ghosts will come for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

800
00:58:53.780 --> 00:58:56.783
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>What happened to the other people</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>you came in contact with?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

801
00:58:56.866 --> 00:58:59.118
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>The ghosts that visit you early on</i></font><font color="white"></font>

802
00:58:59.202 --> 00:59:02.622
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>will be the nasty ones</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>that harass and torment others.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

803
00:59:02.705 --> 00:59:03.957
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>You believe in all this?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

804
00:59:04.040 --> 00:59:06.501
{\an8}<font color="white">-There must be something about ghosts.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Look.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

805
00:59:06.584 --> 00:59:08.711
{\an8}<font color="white">Look at him stuffing his face</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with all that garlic.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

806
00:59:08.795 --> 00:59:10.255
{\an8}<font color="white">What's gotten into him?</font><font color="white"></font>

807
00:59:10.338 --> 00:59:11.381
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>You swore on your life</i></font><font color="white"></font>

808
00:59:11.464 --> 00:59:14.676
{\an8}<font color="white">that you'd help me take over Reina</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">once you get out of here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

809
00:59:15.260 --> 00:59:16.094
{\an8}<font color="white">Did you mean that?</font><font color="white"></font>

810
00:59:17.053 --> 00:59:18.096
{\an8}<font color="white">You bet I did.</font><font color="white"></font>

811
00:59:18.930 --> 00:59:21.599
{\an8}<font color="white">It makes no sense that a murderer like him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is getting released!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

812
00:59:21.683 --> 00:59:23.101
{\an8}<font color="white">Park Seung-jae.</font><font color="white"></font>

813
00:59:23.184 --> 00:59:26.980
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>I plan to find a weakness</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>instead of going after you.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

814
00:59:27.063 --> 00:59:28.064
{\an8}<font color="white"><i>Cheon Yeo-ri.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

815
00:59:28.815 --> 00:59:33.820
{\an8}<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Jennifer Jean Lim</font><font color="white"></font>
